  ('bali-indonesia', '07A', 'Bali', 'Indonesia', 'Rice terraces, temples and surf', 'live', 'verified', 'mountainValley', 'Bali — Indonesia', '{"romance","wellness","culture","culinary","tropical","diveglobal","family","ultra","adventure","hiking"}', '{}', '{}', null, null, '{"currency":"IDR","node_tier":"ANCHOR","dossier_tier":"ANCHOR","si_disregarded":[{"si":"liveaboard","reason":"not-a-liveaboard-node - Bali is the air gateway, not the berth"},{"si":"safari","reason":"not-a-safari-node"},{"si":"river","reason":"rafting is a day activity, not a river-cruise product"},{"si":"entertainment","reason":"no venue, schedule or ticket price sourced"},{"si":"expedition","reason":"not-sourced-in-this-build"}],"key_facts":["UNESCO inscribed ''Cultural Landscape of Bali Province: the Subak System as a Manifestation of the Tri Hita Karana Philosophy'' in 2012, covering 19,519.3 hectares across five sites. Source: UNESCO WHL 1194, accessed 2026-08-23.","Every international tourist pays a levy of IDR 150,000 under Bali Provincial Regulation No. 2 of 2025, amending Regional Regulation No. 6 of 2023. Source: lovebali.baliprov.go.id, accessed 2026-08-23.","The FCDO advises against all travel to six Indonesian volcano exclusion zones and NONE of them is in Bali. Source: gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/indonesia/regional-risks, read 2026-08-23.","Sacred Monkey Forest Sanctuary: IDR 130,000 adult, IDR 100,000 child; 09:00-18:00, last entry 17:00; over 1,054 long-tailed macaques. Source: monkeyforestubud.com, accessed 2026-08-23.","Peak is July-August plus 20 December-5 January; top villas at peak are gone by February-March, a 6-12 month lead. Source: our own output/VILLAS-SUPPLY-STAYWELL.md.","Sanglah General Hospital, Denpasar is the serious-care and hyperbaric referral for Komodo and Raja Ampat. Source: our own output/komodo-indonesia.md and output/raja-ampat-indonesia.md."],"timing":{"peak":"Jul-Aug; 20 Dec-5 Jan","shoulder":"Apr-Jun; Sep-Oct","green":"Nov-Mar (wet)","best_months":"Apr-Oct (dry)","booking_lead":"6-12 months at peak; top villas gone by Feb-Mar","inflection":"Sep-Feb of the prior year - the booking curve starts rising as soon as the prior peak clears; top villas for Jul-Aug are gone by Feb-Mar","fire_date":"late Aug / early Sep of the prior year - 1-2 weeks before the ramp BEGINS, never before the peak (TDT law, worked backward from a 6-12 month lead)"},"safety":{"booking_hold":false,"authority":"FCDO","source":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/indonesia","page_reviewed":"2026-08-16","read":"2026-08-23","alert_status":"avoid_all_travel_to_parts","areas_named":"six volcano exclusion zones - Lewotobi Laki-Laki 7km, Sinabung 5km, Marapi 3km, Semeru 5km (+13km SE, 500m from any Besuk Kobokan riverbank), Ruang 7km, Ibu 7km. NONE in Bali.","notes_verbatim":["Reported cases of rape and sexual assault are high in Bali and Lombok.","There have been reports of drink spiking linked to sexual assault in Bali, Lombok and the Gili Islands.","There are often reports of bag-snatching in Bali.","There has been a large increase in moped and motorbike accidents - some fatal - in Bali.","There has been a rise in the number of scams at tattoo parlours, nail salons and spas in Bali.","If you call a taxi, use only registered companies, such as Bluebird, Silverbird or Express, and check the driver''s identity.","Police often raid venues popular with foreigners, especially in Bali.","Mount Agung continues to show signs of volcanic activity and the possibility of volcanic eruptions remains. Climbers are recommended to limit activity around the crater."],"hospital":"Sanglah General Hospital, Denpasar - regional referral for eastern Indonesia dive incidents (verify chamber readiness with operator/DAN)","fcdo":{"posture":"1","_posture_is_ours":"OUR classification of the FCDO''s page, never her booking posture. The FCDO publishes no level and we assign none."},"fcdo_zones":[{"name":"within 7km of the crater of Mount Lewotobi Laki-Laki on Flores Island, East Nusa Tenggara Province","lvl":4,"posture":"all"},{"name":"within 5km of the crater of Mount Sinabung in Karo Regency, North Sumatra","lvl":4,"posture":"all"},{"name":"within 3km of the crater of Mount Marapi in West Sumatra","lvl":4,"posture":"all"},{"name":"within 5km of the crater of Mount Semeru in Lumajang Regency, East Java","lvl":4,"posture":"all","note":"Also, in the south-east of Mount Semeru, to within 500m from any riverbank of the Besuk Kobokan river for 13km from the crater."},{"name":"within 7km of the crater of Mount Ruang in Northern Sulawesi","lvl":4,"posture":"all"},{"name":"within 7km of the crater of Mount Ibu in North Maluku Province","lvl":4,"posture":"all"}]},"geo":null,"seo":{"canonical":"/destination/bali-indonesia","keywords":["bali subak unesco","jatiluwih terraces","mount agung advice","bali tourist levy","when to book bali villa","tulamben liberty wreck"],"attribution":{"author":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"publisher":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World LLC"},"reviewed_by":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"digital_source_type":"CompositeWithTrainedAlgorithmicMediaDigitalSource","digital_source_vocab":"https://schema.org/IPTCDigitalSourceEnumeration","last_verified":null,"last_verified_basis":"unprovable — no source_verified date and no FCDO read stamp"},"meta_title":"Bali, Indonesia — TravelWell.World","meta_description":"Terraced water temples, volcanic coast and the subak landscape — when to go, what the Foreign Office actually says, and how far ahead to book a villa."},"booking":{"advisory_updated":"2026-08-23","advisory_source":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/indonesia","page_reviewed":"2026-08-16","note":"FCDO is the authority. Indonesia is AREA-RESTRICTED: the FCDO advises against all travel to six volcano exclusion zones (Lewotobi Laki-Laki 7km, Sinabung 5km, Marapi 3km, Semeru 5km, Ruang 7km, Ibu 7km) and NONE is in Bali. Mount Agung is named with no exclusion zone